5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's be practical. I want to know who is actually using the room and who is cleaning up after everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm concerned about the noise and the mess. I'll look into the wall and the desks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to consider the hidden costs of our time. I shall look into the invoices and the facilities callouts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see the money side of things! I'll check the quotes and the invoices too!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we need a place to actually talk to each other. I'll check the unplanned talk and the awkward conversations.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, do you think the mess is that bad? I'll check the fridge clear-out as well.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It is noticeable.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Balance is key, May.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, that sounds like a mystery! I'm excited to see what we find!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Thanks, Sakura! I just want us to be closer.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
