30,2,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,May,,"It's exactly as I thought. A couple of people hog the room, and one person does all the cleaning.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is far too thin. Everything said in there is heard outside. Also, people are eating at their desks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,We are spending a significant amount on outside rentals for very small groups. It seems inefficient.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"We've spent 68,000 yen on outside rooms! And the fit-out for a meeting space is the most expensive option.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,We have no place for private talks. The last awkward conversation happened right in front of everyone. It's not right.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if people are eating at desks, maybe a kitchen is the answer? But who will clean it?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,A kitchen would only increase the noise and smell. We need something that doesn't disturb the office.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,A kitchen requires maintenance. I noticed that simple rooms with only chairs cause the fewest problems for facilities.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,But we keep paying for outside rooms! Why not just make it a meeting space so we stop wasting money?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"A meeting space could work, but only if it's for more than just formal work. We need a place to connect.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, the cost of the fit-out is high, but the rental costs are recurring. That's a fair point.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If it's a meeting space, we must address the wall. Otherwise, it's not private.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The peace of the office is a fragile thing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just don't want us to keep paying month by month for something we could have here!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"If we have a dedicated space, we can finally stop talking by the printer.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I'm torn. A kitchen is tempting for the social side, but the cleaning is a nightmare.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote against anything that brings more crumbs into the main office.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider which option serves the most people without burdening the few.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm leaning towards the meeting space to save money in the long run!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree. A meeting space allows for the private conversations we desperately need.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
